<title>UK: Laporte up as BZW upgrades to &quot;buy&quot;.</title>
<headline>Laporte up as BZW upgrades to &quot;buy&quot;.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in speciality chemicals group Laporte Plc rose on Wednesday as analysts at BZW raised the stock to a &quot;buy,&quot; dealers said.</p>
<p>The stock, which fell to a 14-month low of 622p on February 28, was up 7p at 661-1/2 by 1042 GMT.</p>
<p>BZW analysts were not immediately available for comment.</p>
<p>-- David Holmes, London Newsroom +44 171 542 4367</p>
</text>
